{"id":346055,"date":"2019-06-04T18:52:57","date_gmt":"2019-06-04T18:52:57","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/ccra.us\/?p=346055"},"modified":"2019-06-04T19:37:28","modified_gmt":"2019-06-04T19:37:28","slug":"kk7wk-ex-kc6snw-day-of-remembrance-set-for-june-9th-in-portland-oregon","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"http:\/\/ccra.us\/2019\/06\/04\/kk7wk-ex-kc6snw-day-of-remembrance-set-for-june-9th-in-portland-oregon\/","title":{"rendered":"KK7WK (ex KC6SNW) Day of Remembrance set for June 9th in Portland, Oregon"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\"><figure class=\"aligncenter is-resized\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-attachment-id=\"346063\" data-permalink=\"http:\/\/ccra.us\/2019\/06\/04\/kk7wk-ex-kc6snw-day-of-remembrance-set-for-june-9th-in-portland-oregon\/kurt-hallmeyer-kk7wk-ex-kc6snw-sk\/\" data-orig-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/ccra.us\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/06\/Kurt-Hallmeyer-KK7WK-ex-KC6SNW-SK.jpg?fit=403%2C403\" data-orig-size=\"403,403\" data-comments-opened=\"0\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;2.8&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;iPhone 4&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;1374096939&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;3.85&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;80&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0.0069444444444444&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;1&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"Kurt Hallmeyer, KK7WK (ex KC6SNW) SK on or about May 6, 2019\" data-image-description=\"&lt;p&gt;Kurt Hallmeyer, KK7WK (ex KC6SNW) SK on or about May 6, 2019&lt;\/p&gt;\n\" data-image-caption=\"&lt;p&gt;Kurt Hallmeyer, KK7WK (ex KC6SNW) SK on or about May 6, 2019&lt;\/p&gt;\n\" data-medium-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/ccra.us\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/06\/Kurt-Hallmeyer-KK7WK-ex-KC6SNW-SK.jpg?fit=300%2C300\" data-large-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/ccra.us\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/06\/Kurt-Hallmeyer-KK7WK-ex-KC6SNW-SK.jpg?fit=403%2C403\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/ccra.us\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/06\/Kurt-Hallmeyer-KK7WK-ex-KC6SNW-SK.jpg?resize=422%2C422\" alt=\"Kurt Hallmeyer, KK7WK (ex KC6SNW) SK on or about May 6, 2019\" class=\"wp-image-346063\" width=\"422\" height=\"422\" srcset=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/ccra.us\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/06\/Kurt-Hallmeyer-KK7WK-ex-KC6SNW-SK.jpg?w=403 403w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/ccra.us\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/06\/Kurt-Hallmeyer-KK7WK-ex-KC6SNW-SK.jpg?resize=150%2C150 150w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/ccra.us\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/06\/Kurt-Hallmeyer-KK7WK-ex-KC6SNW-SK.jpg?resize=300%2C300 300w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 422px) 100vw, 422px\" \/><figcaption>Kurt Hallmeyer, KK7WK (ex KC6SNW) SK on or about May 6, 2019<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/div>\n\n\n\n<p> Greetings,&nbsp;A Celebration of Life has been organized in remembrance of Kurt on Sunday, June 9<sup class=\"\">th<\/sup>&nbsp;from  1-4 pm at the Highlands Community Clubhouse at 12930 SW Peachvale  Street, Portland, OR 97224.&nbsp; An evite invitation with further  information is available at&nbsp;<a class=\"\" href=\"https:\/\/nam03.safelinks.protection.outlook.com\/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fevite.me%2Fd7vXMzH6hz&amp;data=02%7C01%7Cdel.pullen%40centralsquare.com%7C4fab5d742a484a32c72f08d6e2b0af46%7Cc2c94f3cb566449198434ec9d795ced0%7C1%7C0%7C636945645826655108&amp;sdata=xx7o29lbg6%2FuUKTADgakCCARdbzJLswJN8wPgn1fKAU%3D&amp;reserved=0\">http:\/\/evite.me\/d7vXMzH6hz<\/a>.&nbsp; Please RSVP if you are able to intend.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>The family has selected Dogs for Better Lives (<a class=\"\" href=\"https:\/\/linkprotect.cudasvc.com\/url?a=https%3a%2f%2fdogsforbetterlives.org%2f&amp;c=E,1,IZtIO1T0X7iTZE73cNJDVdjttPNEZsES6Inb4RafhNIGqs_tLRhAwIAueQNkA8nT8xcyJ0QLFZZQsoBwiCg8BG417fs8NjowYm31SdwlIg,,&amp;typo=1\">https:\/\/dogsforbetterlives.org\/<\/a>)  as a charity that friends can support in honor of Kurt.&nbsp; When donating  online, there is a comments field where you can indicate your gift is in  remembrance of Kurt.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Several people have requested contact information for Kurt\u2019s parents to provide a sympathy card.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Mr. and Mrs. Wesley Hallmeyer<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>48 Margaret Drive<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Walnut Creek, CA&nbsp; 94596-6047<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>(925) 935-3828&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Please forward a copy of this email to anyone you can think of that I may have overlooked.&nbsp;I look forward to seeing many of you on the 9<sup class=\"\">th<\/sup>.&nbsp;I know that his family and friends have been comforted by your condolences and support. <\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Greetings,&nbsp;A Celebration of Life has been organized in remembrance of Kurt on Sunday, June 9th&nbsp;from 1-4 pm at the Highlands Community Clubhouse at 12930 SW Peachvale Street, Portland, OR 97224.&nbsp; <a class=\"more-link\" href=\"http:\/\/ccra.us\/2019\/06\/04\/kk7wk-ex-kc6snw-day-of-remembrance-set-for-june-9th-in-portland-oregon\/\">Continue Reading &rarr;<\/a><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"_jetpack_newsletter_access":"","_jetpack_dont_email_post_to_subs":false,"_jetpack_newsletter_tier_id":0,"_jetpack_memberships_contains_paywalled_content":false,"_jetpack_memberships_contains_paid_content":false,"footnotes":""},"categories":[1],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-346055","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","hentry","category-uncategorized"],"jetpack_featured_media_url":"","jetpack_sharing_enabled":true,"jetpack_shortlink":"https:\/\/wp.me\/p69ory-1s1x","_links":{"self":[{"href":"http:\/\/ccra.us\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/346055","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"http:\/\/ccra.us\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"http:\/\/ccra.us\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embed